  "finding": "Five of 60 updates that changed a stored value exceeded 100 ms, with a maximum of 1015 ms. Sixty reads and 60 updates assigning the existing value stayed at or below 15 ms. The pause reproduces without Wallet WASM or Durable Object storage. The two UPDATE forms differ in SQL text and parameter binding; an identical-SQL control follows.",
  "limitationsOfChangedDbMetadata": "D1 reports changed_db=true and one row written for both update categories. These fields alone do not identify a physical durable write."
